# Exclusion Tabs — four Skia tab boxes (Home, Changelog, Career, About) merged by a blur + alpha-threshold metaball layer; the active tab separates from its neighbours (±10 pt timing) and turns blue, others gooily merge.
# What this test covers: activating each tab in order and in reverse, jumping between the far ends, re-tapping the
# active tab, switching while the 300 ms separation timing is mid-flight, a rapid burst across all tabs, and taps in
# the gaps / outside the boxes (Touchable.Path hit-testing: ignored).
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/exclusion-tabs"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 40000
wait 1000
# Every tab, left to right, then back.
press 155 437
wait 600
press 255 437
wait 600
press 345 437
wait 600
press 255 437
wait 600
press 155 437
wait 600
press 60 437
wait 600
# Far ends.
press 345 437
wait 600
press 60 437
wait 600
# Re-tap the active tab.
press 60 437
wait 500
# Switch mid-flight.
press 255 437
wait 100
press 155 437
wait 100
press 345 437
wait 800
# Rapid burst.
press 60 437
press 155 437
press 255 437
press 345 437
press 60 437
wait 1000
# Outside the boxes: above the row and at the far left edge.
press 200 380
wait 400
press 5 437
wait 600
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
press "label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
